/// | 32x16x8    | RGBA8  | 4               | 1 * 1 * 1        | 32 * 4 = 128 padded to 256 = Some(256) | None                         |
/// | 256x256    | BC3    | 16              | 4 * 4 * 1        | 16 * (256 / 4) = 1024 = Some(1024)     | None                         |
/// | 64x64x8    | BC3    | 16              | 4 * 4 * 1        | 16 * (64 / 4) = 256 = Some(256)        | 64 / 4 = 16 = Some(16)       |
